<title>USA: U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said the 18.668 million bushels of wheat, 19.329 million of corn and 473,000 of barley inspected for export in the week ended Oct 10 were for the following shipment from port areas or inland inspection points (1,000 bu).</p>
<p>	     Wheat     Corn	Barley</p>
<p> Lakes     5,312	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Atlantic    Nil	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Gulf	6,212   18,744	  Nil</p>
<p> Pacific   6,887	Nil	  473</p>
<p> Interior    257	585	  Nil</p>
</text>
